ERROR:  the current branch main has no upstream branch
HINT:  Name the remote, or set an upstream with dolt_push('--set-upstream', 'origin', 'main').
SELECT dolt_remote('remove', 'bad');
 dolt_remote 
-------------
 {0}
(1 row)

